{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "schinese", "appid": 924970, "month": "2021-11", "window": 4, "start_date": 1637712000, "end_date": 1638316799, "month_true_total": 2312, "quota": 46, "returned": 46, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:03:36 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "104897150", "author": {"steamid": "76561198181135890", "personaname": "Eternal Bubble", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198181135890/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 4906, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3240, "last_played": 1662149177, "avatar": "87110f1b1778e027714ddb44261d7affc77b78d5"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "it's a really good game since back to blood 2", "timestamp_created": 1638307859, "timestamp_updated": 1638307859, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.499136120080947876", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104884707", "author": {"steamid": "76561198376808444", "personaname": "带刀护士", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/La_La_Dan/", "num_games_owned": 51, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 85857, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 21357, "last_played": 1767556571, "avatar": "be183394646da5c235b8948c0cbd23aa73faa54d"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "买之前我预期这是纯粹的射击游戏，玩了一段时间后发现这是个近战动作游戏，再后来觉得这是一个解谜游戏，因为游戏里有太多需要探索才知道的奇怪的知识了（bugs...？）。\n\n总的来说，我觉得这是升级版的L4D，内容和机制都丰富了很多。虽然平衡性有过一些改动，虽然噩梦难度真的是太难了，虽然跑酷玩法有一点违背 “合作游戏” 的定位。。。\n\n但我还是推荐这个游戏，因为遇到了很多不同地区和语言，愿意沟通和配合的路人玩家，大家都有在尝试想办法解决问题，这个体验感还是不错的~~~我承认我很菜，经常倒地，经常打鸟。。。哈哈\n\nTo know more about weapons and riddens:\nhttps://statty.net/\n\nTo track your nightmare progress for ZWAT skin:\nhttps://b4bstats.mazz.lol/\n\nRecommend Youtuber:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/c/SwingPoynt", "timestamp_created": 1638301501, "timestamp_updated": 1638301501, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.528124451637268066", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104861587", "author": {"steamid": "76561198156010325", "personaname": "喵喵侠wula", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198156010325/", "num_games_owned": 118, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 15968, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7665, "last_played": 1705332730, "avatar": "54c5557130ddea2e2951f5418efebf05d8f5ec77"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "爷青回。希望出更多地图和卡牌难度！", "timestamp_created": 1638290599, "timestamp_updated": 1638290599, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104858390", "author": {"steamid": "76561198154754225", "personaname": "❤️低·语⭐", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/HeianDiyu/", "num_games_owned": 474, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 4890, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1295, "last_played": 1752318032, "avatar": "a4419bfe474912014e1e1fa7fe1841e0d80c88a6"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "我太菜，但我还想玩\n我是预购玩家 我下次不预购了", "timestamp_created": 1638289228, "timestamp_updated": 1718685157, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54356849193572998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_durin